  <VPE_EltexMeteor.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription->A large meteorite has struck ground nearby. It has left behind a lump of eltex. Eltex can be used to create psyfocus-enhancing gear, or sold to the Empire to gain honor.
You can send a mining party to retrieve it, but chances are if you wait long enough, someone else will lay claim to it.--><li>questDescription-&gt;一颗巨大的陨石撞击了此区域的地面。留下了一块灵质。灵质可以用来打造强化心灵能力的装备，或是卖给帝国征募官。</li></VPE_EltexMeteor.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
